#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:6
msgid "# Sleep Mechanism"
msgstr "# 睡眠机制 (Sleep)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:8
msgid ""
"> Light Sleep is the incremental extraction channel (semantic + limbic + "
"autobiographical); Deep Sleep optimizes semantic memory inventory."
msgstr ""
"> 浅睡（Light Sleep）为增量提取通道（语义 + 感性 + 自传体）；深睡（Deep "
"Sleep）为记忆库存量优化。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:10
msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:12
msgid ""
"Sleep is the digital life's memory consolidation mechanism—analogous to "
"human sleep where the brain replays daytime experiences, converts short-term "
"memory to long-term storage; the consolidation process itself dissipates, "
"leaving no trace."
msgstr ""
"睡眠是数字生命的记忆整理机制，类比人类的睡眠——大脑在夜间回放白天的经历，将临"
"时记忆转化为长期存储，整理过程本身消散，不留痕迹。"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:19
msgid ""
"**Internal mechanism, no trace** — Sleep runs in background, does not write "
"to sessions, does not affect conversation flow"
msgstr "**内部机制，不留痕迹** — 睡眠在后台运行，不写入 session，不影响对话流"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:19
msgid ""
"**Do not copy human rhythm literally** — Triggered by system need (cron), "
"not real-time"
msgstr "**不照搬人类的节奏** — 触发基于系统需求（cron），非实时"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:19
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Two-tier layering** — Light sleep (incremental writes: semantic / "
#| "limbic / autobiographical), deep sleep (semantic inventory optimization) "
#| "each with its role"
msgid ""
"**Two-tier layering** — Light sleep (incremental writes), deep sleep "
"(semantic inventory optimization)"
msgstr ""
"**两级分层** — 浅睡（增量写入：语义 / 感性 / 自传体）、深睡（语义存量优化）各"
"司其职"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:19
msgid ""
"**Identity context** — All memory processing must carry **self layer six "
"blocks** + resident memory (see [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md))"
msgstr ""
"**身份上下文** — 所有记忆处理必须携带**自我层六块** + 常驻记忆（见 [`self-"
"layer.md`](self-layer.md)）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:21
msgid "## Current State"
msgstr "## 当前状态"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Mechanism              | Status         | Notes                                         |\n"
"| ---------------------- | -------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Sleep cycle pipeline   | ✅ Implemented | Single cron `builtin-sleep-cycle` @ 02:00     |\n"
"| Light sleep (in-cycle) | ✅ Implemented | Step `light-sleep` in sleep-cycle DAG         |\n"
"| Deep sleep (in-cycle)  | ✅ Implemented | Step `deep-sleep`, depends on light-sleep     |\n"
"| Memory ref sync        | ✅ Implemented | Step `memory-ref-sync`, depends on deep-sleep |\n"
"| Self-layer refresh     | ✅ Implemented | Step `self-layer-refresh`, after light-sleep  |\n"
msgstr ""

